01:17:13.000 --> 01:17:17.000
A woman: I mean, it's horrible. Dr. Khalifa: Yes. And usually she's studying for, you know, school of medicine.

01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:21.000
Dr. Khalifa: She's up until 2 o'clock in the morning or something. And she puts her head down and then there comes this guy.

01:17:22.000 --> 01:17:26.000
They actually complained to the police about him. But he won.

01:17:27.000 --> 01:17:28.000
Yes.

01:17:29.000 --> 01:17:30.000
It's really terrible.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:31.000
One hour.

01:17:32.000 --> 01:17:36.000
Dr. Khalifa: You're right. They don't do it in other prayers. Only in the Fajr Prayer.

01:17:36.000 --> 01:17:38.000
A woman: And the one that nobody would (unintelligible). Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

